{"r":"wfD","lane":{"p":2957,"e":[{"h":"وَفَضَ","t":["(A, Mgh, K.) aor. ",[2,"يَفِضُ"],", (K,) inf. n. ",[2,"وَفْضٌ"]," (A, K) and ",[2,"وَفَضٌ"],"; (IDrd, K;) and ↓ ",[2,"اوفض"],", (S, Mgh, K,) and ↓ ",[2,"استوفض"],"; (S, K;) ",[1,"He ran:"]," (A, Mgh, K:) ",[1,"he hastened,"]," or ",[1,"went quickly."]," (S, A, Mgh, K.) Hence, in the Kur. [lxx. 43,] ↓ ",[2,"كَأَنَّهُمْ إِلَى نُصُبٍ يُوفِضُونَ"],", or ",[2,"نَصْبٍ"],", ",[1,"As though they were hastening,"]," or ",[1,"going quickly, to a thing set up for worship."]," (Fr, S, TA.) You say also ",[2,"وَفَضَتِ الإِبَلُ"],[1,"The camels hastened,"]," or ",[1,"went quickly:"]," (M:) or ",[1,"went the pace termed"],[2,"خَبَب"],". (Khaleefeh El-Hoseynee.) And ",[1,"The camels became dispersed:"]," (AA:) and ↓ ",[2,"استوفضت"],[1,"they became dispersed"]," (K, TA) ",[1,"in their pasturing."]," (TA.)"],"f":"1"},{"h":"اوفض","t":[": see 1, in two places. -A2- Also, ",[1,"He made"]," a she-camel ",[1,"to go the pace termed"],[2,"خَبَب"],"; as also ",[2,"اوضف"],". (Khaleefeh El-Hoseynee.) And ",[1,"He dispersed"]," camels. (The same, and K.) See also 10. -A3- ",[2,"اوفض لَهُ"],[1,"He spread for him a carpet,"]," or ",[1,"the like, by which to preserve himself from the ground;"]," (K, TA;) as also ",[2,"اوضم"],". (TA)"],"f":"4"},{"h":"استوفض","t":[": see 1, in two places. -A2- Also, ",[1,"He required,"]," or ",[1,"commanded,"]," another ",[1,"to hasten,"]," or ",[1,"be quick,"]," or ",[1,"he hastened, hurried,"]," or ",[1,"urged,"]," him. (S, M, A, K, [but in the M; it seems to relate to camels, or an ostrich.]) ― -b2- ",[1,"He drove away"]," (S, M, K) camels, or an ostrich; as also ↓ ",[2,"اوفض"],": (M:) ",[1,"he drove away,"]," or ",[1,"expelled,"]," another ",[1,"from his country:"]," (M:) ",[1,"he banished"]," him. (Mgh, K.)"],"f":"10"},{"h":"وَفْضٌ","t":["(S, M, K,) and ↓ ",[2,"وَفَضٌ"]," (M, K) ",[1,"Haste:"]," (S, M, K:) [like ",[2,"وَفْزٌ"]," and ",[2,"وَفَزٌ"],":] pl. ",[2,"أَوْفَاضٌ"],". (K.) You say, ",[2,"جَآءَ عَلَى 